      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In \u00b7 partners\n\n\u2022 Broker upload / email\n\u2022 External security signal\n  (mock now \u00b7 partner later)\n\u2022 Book list for vendor rollup\n\u2022 Client appetite rules\n  (swappable config)",
